── List configured peers ──
$ sac host list
(sac not installed or no peers configured)

── spec.yaml: pin an agent to one host ──
spec:
  host: spartan
  runtime: apptainer
  apptainer:
    image: ~/.scitex/agent-container/containers/sac-scitex.sif

── spec.yaml: one copy per host ──
spec:
  hosts: [mba, spartan, nas]
  runtime: apptainer

── Dispatch a command on a remote peer ──
$ sac --on spartan agents list
  # → runs on spartan, output streamed back
$ sac --on spartan agents start my-agent
$ sac --on spartan agents tail  my-agent --json -n 5

── Probe a peer (handy when --on hangs) ──
$ sac host probe spartan
  # → ssh round-trip ms, sac --version on peer, agent count
